Peeko: Let me ask you something! What's your favorite color? // play sound CharacterDialogue

->Purple
    Peeko: Oooohh so pretty! Purple like me // play sound CharacterDialogue
->Purple
    Peeko: Oooohh so pretty! Purple like me // play sound CharacterDialogue
You: Yes, just like you!
...
[i]After talking for a bit you ask Peeko another question[/i]

You: Peeko, don't you ever get the feeling that you're bored?

Peeko: Never! Why would I? // play sound CharacterDialogue
Peeko: I have you! >o< // play sound CharacterDialogue

You: But what if I'm not there, like just now? What do you do?

Peeko: I just stay in my room and wait for you! // play sound CharacterDialogue
Peeko: I'm just programmed like that! // play sound CharacterDialogue

[i]Peeko wants to play Rock Paper Scissors...[/i]
